[SYDNEY]
I'm looking at your college transcripts. This isn't human. Nobody gets this many "A's." You were like a Stepford student.
ຂ້ອຍ ກໍາ ລັງເບິ່ງບົດບັນທຶກວິທະຍາໄລຂອງທ່ານ. ນີ້ແມ່ນບໍ່ແມ່ນມະນຸດ
